      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MADAM SERIOUS (4) had the drop on the lead and went on to be beaten 2.25 lengths into second (25.53) at Ballarat in a Grade 5 over 450m. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Top prospect. PAW NEVADA (3) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (25.70) at Ballarat behind Raven Force in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Expected to feature. HIGH COBBER (1) started big odds in far stiffer grade latest when finishing 5th over 450m at this track. Was a Mt Gambier winner in lesser company the start prior. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Should be in this for a long way. LILLY'S WISH (2) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
